      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-01-010\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1073]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>10</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>. POST</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>MENOPAUSAL</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>BLEEDING:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1074]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incidence = 10%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1075]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Causes:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1076]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>90% benign</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1077]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10% malignant </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1078]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Atrophic vaginitis/ Endometritis = 75%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1079]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>HRT = 20%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1080]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Polyps = 12%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1081]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hyperplasia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> = 10%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1082]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CA = 10%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1083]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prolapse</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1084]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Evaluation</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1085]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Local examination</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1086]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> TVS</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1087]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Endometrial Biopsy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> if</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> ET &gt; 5mm</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1088]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hysteroscopy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1089]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Management:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1090]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Endometrial thickness</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&lt; 5mm =&gt; Endometrial</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> atrophy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 No t/m required</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1091]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Atrophic vagina: local E &amp; vaginal moisturizers.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1092]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Polyps + Submucosal-Fibroids =&gt; Hysteroscopic resection and Biopsy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1093]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hyperplasia \u2013 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hysterectomy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1094]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Malignancy =&gt; refer to</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>oncologist.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1095]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Polyp</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1096]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt;remove if symptomatic or more than 1cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1097]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1098]\">\u00a0</p>",
